  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Implementation RWI 2011-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Raoul Wallenberg Inst human rights TR 2011-2014 - Implementation RWI 2011-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Efter starten perioden mellan april och september 2011, forts&#xe4;tter    Raoul Wallenberg Institutet (RWI) utveckling av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter kapacitetsutveckling med fyra statliga universitetens lag skolor      (Istanbul, dokuz Eylul (Izmir), Anadolu (Eskisehir) och Selcuk        (Konya)) genom att utveckla nya m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter spr&#xe5;kinl&#xe4;rning, bibliotek st&#xf6;d mellan oktober 2011 och december 2014.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following the inception period between April and September 2011,      Raoul Wallenberg Institute (RWI) continues the development of human   rights capacity development with 4 state universities&apos; law schools    (Istanbul, Dokuz Eylul (Izmir), Anadolu (Eskisehir) and Selcuk        (Konya)) by developing new human rights learning techniques, library  support etc. between October 2011 and December 2014.</narrative>
  </description>
